1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,046
Lonlyn: Greetings!

2
00:00:01,077 --> 00:00:02,999
I am Lonlyn, and I am a farmer.

3
00:00:03,366 --> 00:00:05,373
I have heard of you and your quest.

4
00:00:05,633 --> 00:00:07,340
I am a man of little wealth,

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,333
but all that I have I give you!

